    "summary": "This program offers a broad foundation from which to launch your IT journey, covering highly sought-after IT skills relevant for all industries. Further, when you’re finished, you will have the option of moving straight into our Bachelor program with full credit for the first year. We understand the importance of catering to our students’ needs, so during your Diploma of Information Technology course, we’ve designed a learning program that combines online and campus-based classes to provide our students with the utmost convenience. In today’s IT industry, online collaboration is rapidly becoming the norm, and we’re here to prepare our students for success in various work environments. With only two days of campus-based classes per week, you’ll have the freedom to manage your time effectively while honing your programming skills. Our experienced mentors will guide and support you throughout your journey, ensuring that you stay on track with your original study plan.",
