    "careers": "Professionals in Built Environment have a vast range of career opportunities available. They can explore careers in architecture, construction management, property development, building surveyor, quantity surveyor and more. You will receive a level 5 Diploma. With this qualification you can enter the workforce in your field of study, or continue into an undergraduate degree with the University of Newcastle.",
