    "area": "human structure and function, physical activity and health, human growth & development, academic research and writing in health sciences, exercise health and disease; functional anatomy for human movement; exercise physiology, physiology of training and environmental extremes; motor control development and learning; Psycho-social aspects of sports & physical activity; biomechanics; nutrition for health and physical activity.",
    "courseLevel": "TBP",
