    "area": "Law: Administration law, advocacy, alternative dispute resolution, civil procedure, commercial practice and ethics, contract law, constitutional law, corporations and partnerships, criminal law, equity, evidence, international law, legal history, legal philosophy, legal process and statutory interpretation, legal research and writing, property law, remedies, torts, trusts. Biomedical Science: Biochemistry, exercise physiology, human genetics, immunology, infectious disease, molecular and cell biology, microbiology, neuroscience, pathology, reproductive biology, scientific communication.",
