    "practicalExperience": "You will have the opportunity to gain industry experience through interdisciplinary project units with industry, community or research projects. Students enrolled in any course requiring exposure to animals and wildlife, farm visits, animal handling enterprises, or the handling of animal specimens must be protected against Q Fever infection and Tetanus. Vaccination must be undertaken prior to the commencement of semester one. Details of vaccination requirements.",
