    "practicalExperience": "This course includes two full-time, six-month industry internships, with two different sponsoring employers. The first internship is in the second half of the first year of the course; the second internship is in the first half of the third year of the course. Students are not paid by the sponsoring employer during these internships but continue to receive their scholarship.",
