    "careers": "You can work in any of the areas suggested for the Civil major, plus find opportunities with major commercial developers, government agencies and their contractors, engineering consultancies, particularly those which specialise in designing and building large structures or assessing existing structures. Graduates have the opportunity of working around the world as well as throughout Australia.",
