    "additionalCriteria": "",
    "fees": "Refer to UTS current fee information .",
    "summary": "The UniReady Enabling Program is designed to get you ready for undergraduate study at UTS. Building on your existing strengths and successes, UniReady will help you to develop your knowledge of the university environment, its academic expectations as well as developing your academic literacy and research skills. Through a combination of individual and collaborative learning activities, you will explore strategies for independent learning, time management, and engagement with discipline-specific skills. By the end of this program, you will be equipped with a comprehensive set of academic skills and strategies essential for engaging in higher education. You will also receive embedded support from the Priority Student Success Team and Jumbunna Institute for Indigenous Education and Research (Aboriginal and/or Torres Strait Islander students). This includes peer mentoring, access to free academic bridging courses, and individual guidance in UniReady and into your undergraduate degree. Students who successfully complete the UniReady program will be offered a place to study in an undergraduate degree at UTS.",
    "careers": "Successful completion of the UniReady Enabling program will allow you to progress into the first year of selected University of Technology Sydney bachelor degrees.",
