    "careers": "With a combined Animal Science and Zoology degree, you can excel in roles like wildlife rehabilitation, zoological research, animal health & welfare advocacy, animal nutritionists, reproduction technologists, quarantine officers and environmental impact assessors. Your unique skill set also positions you for leadership roles in sustainable agriculture, developing innovative animal-based products, and addressing complex global challenges related to food security and biodiversity. Some graduates have gone onto do further studies in Veterinary Medicine.",
