    "campusCode": "PA",
    "campusPostcode": "2116",
    "area": "In your second/third years, choose complementary subjects in either journalism or design, depending on your area of interest. If you’d like a future career creating short or long-form documentaries or insightful exposés, choose journalism subjects. If you’re more interested in creating interactive online experiences, apps and games design, choose design subjects.",
    "courseLevel": "TBP",
    "atar": "70.80",
